# Probe (slice 289): a literal index too wide for size_t at the L3 INDEX of a root's own pointer -- CHECK receives the index
# by the ordinary numeric reception, whose literal kind refuses it.
[]: int cells 2
@: pc int @ cells[0U]
int: got pc[18446744073709551616U]
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: got; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
